# images/ and .venv/ are symlinks into the lab this one mirrors. Committing a
# symlink would leave a clone pointing at a path that does not exist there, so
# both are excluded: run ./setup.sh for the virtualenv and supply the base
# images as described in README.md. The Cisco qcow2 is licensed in any case.
images
.venv

# Per-VM overlay disks and generated ISOs, rebuilt from images/ by start-lab.sh.
run/

# Every archived run except one kept as a reference result: the most recent
# *complete* run, which is not always the newest directory.
results/*
!results/results_2026-09-07_194123/

dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
